                "title": "Heart Tip Double Handle Mortise Lockset, Acorn RT3BD / RT3BI",
                "description": "With old world style, the Heart Tip Double Handle Mortise Lockset is perfect for restoration projects, colonial homes, rustic ranches, and so much more. The heart-tip grip adds a bit of whimsy to this sturdy cast iron handleset; while the rough black finish mimics the texture of naturally weathered iron for an authentic appearance. Available in single and dummy cylinder functions, it is good for 1-3/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors with a 2-1/2 inch and 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "Heart Tip Double Handle Mortise Entrysets, Heart Tip Double Handle Mortise Locksets, ACO-RT3BI, Acorn RT3BI, Acorn RT3BD, single cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, Acorn mortise lock handlesets, mortise handlesets, rough iron handlesets, Acorn RT3BD / RT3BI"
